    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Imagine a day filled with laughter, creativity, and a spark of curiosity. That's exactly what the Aga Khan University (AKU) Library in Dar es Salaam delivered when it hosted a vibrant Library Fun Day for AKU staff and their families. Over 70 children, aged between three and 14, were immersed in a world of interactive activities designed to foster a lifelong love of learning.",
